WEBVTT

00:06:57.830 --> 00:07:00.332
Those guys were so motivated,

00:07:00.332 --> 00:07:03.002
that in literally two
or three hours we had done it.

00:07:03.002 --> 00:07:04.420
So I said, "Wait, stop, guys,

00:07:04.462 --> 00:07:07.423
they're going to bring you
back to your cell, give me a second.

00:07:07.423 --> 00:07:09.967
I'm going to try to get
some guards to paste with us."

00:07:10.009 --> 00:07:12.678
And they were like, look,
"We love utopianism and stuff,

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:14.138
but that’s where it stops.”

00:07:14.138 --> 00:07:15.514
"No, just give me a second."

00:07:15.514 --> 00:07:19.059
So I start going to the guards and I say,
"Hey, do you mind participating?"

00:07:19.101 --> 00:07:20.603
Fifty "no," one guy said "yes."

00:07:20.644 --> 00:07:22.146
I say, "Cool, come with me.

00:07:22.188 --> 00:07:23.647
They're going to show you."

00:07:23.689 --> 00:07:25.858
And then another guard and another guard.

00:07:25.900 --> 00:07:28.486
And that's where the real
walls were falling down,

00:07:28.527 --> 00:07:31.822
because there's no communication
between those guards and the inmates.